{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Let the earth sprout.</b> The earth was made matter for the possessors of the vegetative soul. And here the earth corrupted its charge: for the earlier utterance was ״עץ פרי עושה פרי״ — a fruit tree making fruit — and she did not do so, but only ״עץ עושה פרי״ — a tree making fruit. And it says:"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:24:46.363401074Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}